OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786724320
OL,3,CBiker avoids jail after kicking
OL,4,Cdelivery driver off bicycle in racist
OL,5,Cattack
OL,7,FFootage shows the moment a man kicked
OL,8,Fa delivery driver off of his bike.
OL,10,FA biker has been handed a suspended
OL,11,Fsentence after he kicked a delivery
OL,12,Fdriver off of his bike in a racially
OL,13,Fmotivated attack.
OL,15,FHarrison Ainsbury, 20, of Watergarth,
OL,16,FBarrow pleaded guilty to driving a
OL,17,Fmotor vehicle dangerously, racially
OL,18,Faggravated assault, and racially
OL,19,Faggravated criminal damage.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
