FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786724320
OL,3,CBiker avoids jail after kicking
OL,4,Cdelivery driver off bicycle in racist
OL,5,Cattack
OL,7,FOn 18 September 2024, Ainsbury was
OL,8,Friding an off-road motorcycle when he
OL,9,Fpassed a food delivery driver on a
OL,10,Fbike. He then kicked the victim,
OL,11,Fcausing him minor injuries as he hit
OL,12,Fthe curb and fell off.
OL,14,FHe was arrested for the offence the
OL,15,Ffollowing day and his phone was seized.
OL,17,FDuring the investigation, officers
OL,18,Ffound video evidence and racist
OL,19,Fmessages proving Ainsbury targeted the
OL,20,Fvictim because of his race.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786724320
OL,3,CBiker avoids jail after kicking
OL,4,Cdelivery driver off bicycle in racist
OL,5,Cattack
OL,7,FHe was sentenced to 12 months in
OL,8,Fprison, suspended for two years,
OL,9,Fdisqualified from driving for 12
OL,10,Fmonths and required to pass an
OL,11,Fextended retest before getting his
OL,12,Flicence back.
OL,14,FHe was also ordered to complete 200
OL,15,Fhours of unpaid work and pay #1,000 in
OL,16,Fcompensation.
OL,18,FThe court described the incident as a
OL,19,Fserious, targeted, and planned attack,
OL,20,Fnoting Ainsbury's "flagrant disregard"
OL,21,Ffor others.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786724320
OL,3,CBiker avoids jail after kicking
OL,4,Cdelivery driver off bicycle in racist
OL,5,Cattack
OL,7,FNeighbourhood Policing Sergeant Jack
OL,8,FHart said: "This was a completely
OL,9,Funprovoked attack on a man who was
OL,10,Fsimply carrying out his job, targeted
OL,11,Fbecause of his race.
OL,13,F"There is no place for this type of
OL,14,Fbehaviour in our communities.
OL,16,F"We know the illegal use of off-road
OL,17,Fbikes has been a long-standing concern
OL,18,Ffor residents across Furness,
OL,19,Fparticularly where they are used to
OL,20,Fintimidate people, commit offences and
OL,21,Fput others at risk.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786724320
OL,3,CBiker avoids jail after kicking
OL,4,Cdelivery driver off bicycle in racist
OL,5,Cattack
OL,7,F"This conviction demonstrates our
OL,8,Fcommitment to identifying offenders,
OL,9,Fgathering evidence and taking robust
OL,10,Faction against those who use bikes to
OL,11,Fcommit crime. We will continue to work
OL,12,Fthrough Operation Blackwater to tackle
OL,13,Foffending and keep our communities
OL,14,Fsafe."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
